<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Metro details capitalisation share award.</title>
<headline>Metro details capitalisation share award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metro Cash and Carry Ltd said on Monday the number of capitalisation shares shareholders will become entitled to will be determined by the ratio that 15 cents per share multiplied by 1.05 bears on the issue price.</p>
<p>The issue price is defined as the weighted average traded price of the company's shares on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange for the three days ending December 12.</p>
<p>In order to qualify for the award, shareholders must be registered on December 13.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
